REVIEW.md

# npm local resolution output, not a source of truth: the pinned host tarball
# bundles @dsh-std/* whose manifests still declare workspace:*, so any committed
# lockfile makes every install fail with EUNSUPPORTEDPROTOCOL. Ignoring it keeps
# the working tree clean after `npm install` and makes the intent explicit.
# CI's contract job fails if a lockfile ever reappears (REVIEW.md G1).
package-lock.json
